ewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7Z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"min-w-0 truncate text-[15px] font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 min-[360px]:text-base sm:text-2xl\">GreenEngineering <span class=\"text-emerald-600\">Tools</span></span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-4 xl:flex 2xl:gap-6\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/\">LCA</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/electrical\">Electrical</a><a href=\"https://solarcalculator.greenengineeringtools.com\" class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-sky-600\">Solar ↗</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/guides\">Guides</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md transition-colors hover:bg-slate-800\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">LCA Workspace</a></div><div class=\"shrink-0 xl:hidden\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-navigation-panel\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-emerald-700 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav></header><main class=\"w-full min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-clip\"><main class=\"bg-slate-50\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Wire Size Calculator\",\"applicationCategory\":\"EngineeringApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Web Browser\",\"url\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com/electrical/wire-size-calculator\",\"description\":\"Find the smallest standard AWG, kcmil or metric conductor that satisfies your selected voltage-drop target. The result also shows an approximate cross-system size, receiving voltage, power loss and reverse-solved maximum length.\",\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"},\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Green Engineering Tools\",\"url\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Green Engineering Tools\",\"item\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Electrical Tools\",\"item\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com/electrical\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Wire Size Calculator\",\"item\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com/electrical/wire-size-calculator\"}]}</script><section class=\"border-b border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-50\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8\"><nav class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-500\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a class=\"hover:text-emerald-700\" href=\"/\">Home</a><span class=\"px-2\">/</span><a class=\"hover:text-emerald-700\" href=\"/electrical\">Electrical tools</a></nav><div class=\"mt-6 max-w-4xl\"><p class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-emerald-700\">Copper &amp; aluminum conductor planning</p><h1 class=\"mt-3 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl\">Wire Size Calculator</h1><p class=\"mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600\">Find the smallest standard AWG, kcmil or metric conductor that satisfies your selected voltage-drop target. The result also shows an approximate cross-system size, receiving voltage, power loss and reverse-solved maximum length.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-bold text-slate-600\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5\">No signup</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5\">AWG + mm²</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5\">DC + AC</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5\">Mobile friendly</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5\">Shareable result</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-3 py-1.5\">Transparent formulas</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1500px] px-2 py-8 sm:px-6 sm:py-12\"><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e w-full\"><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/50 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e border-b border-slate-200 bg-slate-950 px-4 py-5 text-white sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e flex flex-col gap-4 xl:flex-row xl:items-center xl:justify-between\"><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\"><p class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-emerald-300\">Electrical design workspace</p><h2 class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-1 text-xl font-black sm:text-2xl\">Cable, wire size &amp; voltage drop designer</h2><p class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-1 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-300\">DC, single-phase and balanced three-phase calculations with AWG, kcmil and mm² conductors, reverse solving, energy-loss estimates and transparent assumptions.</p></div><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-bold\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-11 rounded-xl border border-slate-600 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-slate-800\">Copy share link</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-11 rounded-xl border border-slate-600 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-slate-800\">Print / save PDF</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-11 rounded-xl border border-slate-600 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2 hover:bg-slate-800\">Reset</button></div></div></div><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8\"><section aria-labelledby=\"preset-heading\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\"><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-2\"><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\"><h3 id=\"preset-heading\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-sm font-black text-slate-950\">Quick design presets</h3><p class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500\">Presets only fill planning inputs. Always replace them with your actual circuit data.</p></div></div><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-6\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-16 rounded-xl border p-3 text-left transition border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-50 ring-2 ring-emerald-100\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e block text-xs font-black text-slate-900\">General circuit</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-1 block text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-500\">230 V single-phase planning example</span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-16 rounded-xl border p-3 text-left transition border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-white\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e block text-xs font-black text-slate-900\">Solar DC</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-1 block text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-500\">PV / DC feeder planning</span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-16 rounded-xl border p-3 text-left transition border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-white\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e block text-xs font-black text-slate-900\">Battery / inverter</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-1 block text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-500\">48 V high-current DC cable planning</span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-16 rounded-xl border p-3 text-left transition border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-white\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e block text-xs font-black text-slate-900\">EV charger</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-1 block text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-500\">240 V single-phase charger planning</span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-16 rounded-xl border p-3 text-left transition border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-white\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e block text-xs font-black text-slate-900\">3-phase motor</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-1 block text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-500\">400 V balanced three-phase planning</span></button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-16 rounded-xl border p-3 text-left transition border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-white\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e block text-xs font-black text-slate-900\">Generator feeder</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-1 block text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-500\">400 V three-phase generator feeder</span></button></div></section><section aria-labelledby=\"mode-heading\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-6\"><h3 id=\"mode-heading\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-sm font-black text-slate-950\">What do you want to solve?</h3><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 lg:grid-cols-5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-12 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs font-black transition sm:text-sm bg-slate-950 text-white shadow-lg\">Required wire size</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-12 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs font-black transition sm:text-sm border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50\">Voltage drop</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-12 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs font-black transition sm:text-sm border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50\">Maximum cable length</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-12 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs font-black transition sm:text-sm border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50\">Maximum current</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-12 rounded-xl px-3 py-2 text-xs font-black transition sm:text-sm border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50\">Cable power loss</button></div></section><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-7 grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.05fr)_minmax(360px,.95fr)]\"><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-w-0 space-y-6\"><section class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 sm:p-5\"><h3 class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e font-black text-slate-950\">1. Electrical load</h3><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><label class=\"block min-w-0\"><span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-xs font-black leading-5 text-slate-600\">Circuit type</span><select class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e input\"><option value=\"dc\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\">DC</option><option value=\"single-phase\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\" selected=\"\">Single-phase AC</option><option value=\"three-phase\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\">Three-phase AC</option></select></label><label class=\"block min-w-0\"><span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-xs font-black leading-5 text-slate-600\">Load input</span><select class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e input\"><option value=\"amps\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\">Current (A)</option><option value=\"watts\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\">Active power (W)</option><option value=\"kw\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\" selected=\"\">Active power (kW)</option><option value=\"kva\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\">Apparent power (kVA)</option></select></label><label class=\"block min-w-0\"><span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-xs font-black leading-5 text-slate-600\">Load (kW)</span><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" class=\"input\" value=\"5\"/></label><label class=\"block min-w-0\"><span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-xs font-black leading-5 text-slate-600\">System voltage (V)</span><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" min=\"1\" max=\"1500\" step=\"any\" class=\"input\" value=\"230\"/></label><label class=\"block min-w-0\"><span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-xs font-black leading-5 text-slate-600\">Power factor (cos φ)</span><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" min=\"0.01\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.01\" class=\"input\" value=\"0.9\"/></label><label class=\"block min-w-0\"><span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-xs font-black leading-5 text-slate-600\">Design-current multiplier</span><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"0.05\" class=\"input\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"mt-1.5 block text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-500\">Leave at 1.00 unless a qualified designer or applicable code requires a larger design current.</span></label></div></section><section class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 sm:p-5\"><h3 class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e font-black text-slate-950\">2. Cable run &amp; conductor</h3><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><label class=\"block min-w-0\"><span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-xs font-black leading-5 text-slate-600\">One-way cable length</span><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_92px] gap-2\"><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" min=\"0\" step=\"any\" class=\"input\" value=\"30\"/><select class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e input\"><option value=\"m\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\" selected=\"\">metres</option><option value=\"ft\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\">feet</option></select></div><span class=\"mt-1.5 block text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-500\">Enter the physical one-way distance. The engine applies the correct circuit path factor.</span></label><label class=\"block min-w-0\"><span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-xs font-black leading-5 text-slate-600\">Conductor material</span><select class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e input\"><option value=\"copper\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\" selected=\"\">Copper</option><option value=\"aluminum\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\">Aluminum</option></select></label><label class=\"block min-w-0\"><span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-xs font-black leading-5 text-slate-600\">Conductor size system</span><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-11 rounded-xl border px-3 text-sm font-black border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-800\">mm²</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-h-11 rounded-xl border px-3 text-sm font-black border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-600\">AWG / kcmil</button></div></label><label class=\"block min-w-0\"><span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-xs font-black leading-5 text-slate-600\">Target voltage drop (%)</span><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" min=\"0.01\" max=\"100\" step=\"0.1\" class=\"input\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"mt-1.5 block text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-500\">3% is a common planning target in some contexts, but allowable drop depends on your jurisdiction and application.</span></label><label class=\"block min-w-0\"><span class=\"mb-1.5 block text-xs font-black leading-5 text-slate-600\">Parallel conductors per phase / pole</span><input type=\"number\" inputMode=\"decimal\" min=\"1\" max=\"24\" step=\"1\" class=\"input\" value=\"1\"/></label></div></section><section class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 sm:p-5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-3 text-left\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e block font-black text-slate-950\">3. Advanced engineering inputs</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-1 block text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500\">Temperature, manufacturer resistance, cable reactance, ampacity and loss-cost assumptions.</span></span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-2xl font-black text-slate-400\">+</span></button></section><button type=\"button\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e w-full min-h-14 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-600 px-5 py-3 text-base font-black text-white shadow-lg shadow-emerald-200 transition hover:bg-emerald-500 lg:hidden\">View calculation results ↓</button></div><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e min-w-0 scroll-mt-24 lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:self-start\"><section class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-950 p-4 text-white shadow-xl sm:p-6\"><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3\"><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\"><p class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-300\">Live result</p><h3 class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-1 text-xl font-black\">Required wire size</h3></div><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e rounded-full border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-slate-300\">Single-phase AC</span></div><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-4 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-slate-400\">Calculated current</p></div><p class=\"mt-1 break-words font-mono text-lg font-black text-white sm:text-xl\">24.155 A</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-4 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-slate-400\">Design current</p></div><p class=\"mt-1 break-words font-mono text-lg font-black text-white sm:text-xl\">24.155 A</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-4 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-slate-400\">Active power</p></div><p class=\"mt-1 break-words font-mono text-lg font-black text-white sm:text-xl\">5 kW</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-4 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-slate-400\">Apparent power</p></div><p class=\"mt-1 break-words font-mono text-lg font-black text-white sm:text-xl\">5.556 kVA</p></div></div><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/40 bg-emerald-500/10 p-5\"><p class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-300\">Voltage-drop sizing result</p><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-2 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-3xl font-black text-white\">4 mm²</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-sm text-emerald-200\">4<!-- --> mm²</span></div><p class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-300\">Nearest cross-system size by area: <!-- -->12 AWG<!-- --> (<!-- -->3.31<!-- --> mm²). This is an area comparison, not a standards-equivalence certification.</p></div><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-4 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-slate-400\">Voltage drop</p></div><p class=\"mt-1 break-words font-mono text-lg font-black text-white sm:text-xl\">6.837 V</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-400\">2.973% at operating current</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-4 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-slate-400\">Receiving voltage</p></div><p class=\"mt-1 break-words font-mono text-lg font-black text-white sm:text-xl\">223.163 V</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-400\">Source 230 V</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-4 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-slate-400\">Design voltage drop</p><span class=\"rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-black bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-300\">PASS</span></div><p class=\"mt-1 break-words font-mono text-lg font-black text-white sm:text-xl\">2.973%</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-400\">Target ≤ 3%</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-4 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-slate-400\">Cable real-power loss</p></div><p class=\"mt-1 break-words font-mono text-lg font-black text-white sm:text-xl\">183.5 W</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-400\">3.67% of active load</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-4 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-slate-400\">Annual cable loss</p></div><p class=\"mt-1 break-words font-mono text-lg font-black text-white sm:text-xl\">535.8 kWh</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-400\">USD 80.37 / year at entered tariff</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-4 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-slate-400\">Maximum length at 3%</p></div><p class=\"mt-1 break-words font-mono text-lg font-black text-white sm:text-xl\">30.28 m</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-4 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-slate-400\">Maximum current at 3%</p></div><p class=\"mt-1 break-words font-mono text-lg font-black text-white sm:text-xl\">24.38 A</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-900 p-4 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-slate-400\">Conductor resistance</p></div><p class=\"mt-1 break-words font-mono text-lg font-black text-white sm:text-xl\">5.24191 Ω/km</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-4 text-slate-400\">copper, 75 °C model</p></div></div><div class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-5 rounded-xl border border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/10 p-4\"><h4 class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-sm font-black text-amber-200\">Safety / code boundary</h4><p class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-amber-100/90\">This is an engineering planning calculator, not an electrical permit or code-compliance approval. Final cable selection must also satisfy local ampacity, installation, protection, fault-current, short-circuit, earthing, terminal and authority requirements.</p></div><details open=\"\" class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 p-4\"><summary class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e cursor-pointer text-sm font-black text-white\">Warnings &amp; missing checks (<!-- -->3<!-- -->)</summary><ul class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-300\"><li class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e flex gap-2\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-amber-300\">•</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\">AC cable reactance is set to 0 Ω/km. For long runs, large conductors, low power factor, or engineering-grade studies, enter the cable manufacturer&#x27;s reactance value.</span></li><li class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e flex gap-2\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-amber-300\">•</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\">The recommended conductor is the minimum standard size that meets the selected voltage-drop target in this model. Thermal ampacity, installation method, grouping, ambient-temperature correction, short-circuit withstand, terminal ratings, and local electrical-code rules must still be checked separately.</span></li><li class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e flex gap-2\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-amber-300\">•</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\">No thermal ampacity has been entered. Voltage-drop compliance alone does not prove that a conductor is safe for the load.</span></li></ul></details><details class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 p-4\"><summary class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e cursor-pointer text-sm font-black text-white\">Calculation assumptions</summary><ul class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-300\"><li class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e flex gap-2\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-emerald-300\">•</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\">Single-phase cable length is the one-way run; the engine accounts for the outgoing and return conductors.</span></li><li class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e flex gap-2\"><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e text-emerald-300\">•</span><span class=\"jsx-275c6bb2e540d32e\">Conductor resistance is calculated at 75 °C from reference material resistivity unless a manufacturer resistance override is supplied.</span></li></ul></details></section></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-slate-200 bg-white\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-18\"><div class=\"space-y-10 text-slate-600\"><section><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-slate-950\">What this wire size result means</h2><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7\">The recommendation is the minimum standard conductor in the selected catalog that satisfies the voltage-drop model at the design current. It is intentionally not presented as a universal code-compliant cable size. Thermal ampacity depends on insulation rating, installation method, ambient temperature, grouping, terminals, local code rules and protection. Those checks cannot be inferred safely from voltage drop alone.</p></section><section class=\"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2\"><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-950\">AWG and kcmil</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6\">US-style conductor sizes are converted through the standard AWG geometry and circular-mil relationship. The tool reports the actual cross-sectional area used in the resistance calculation.</p></article><article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-slate-950\">Metric mm²</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6\">Metric conductor recommendations use common standard cross-sections from 0.5 mm² through large feeder sizes. Parallel runs can be entered when a single conductor is impractical.</p></article></section><section><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-950\">Why a larger cable can save energy</h2><p class=\"mt-3 leading-7\">Larger conductors have lower resistance. That reduces I²R losses and can lower annual energy waste, especially on long runs with high utilization. The calculator therefore shows annual cable-loss energy and cost alongside the voltage-drop result so a designer can compare first-cost and operating-loss tradeoffs.</p></section></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 font-black text-slate-900 transition hover:border-emerald-300 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/electrical/voltage-drop-calculator\">Voltage Drop Calculator<!-- --> →</a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 font-black text-slate-900 transition hover:border-emerald-300 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/electrical/wire-size-calculator\">Wire Size Calculator<!-- --> →</a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 font-black text-slate-900 transition hover:border-emerald-300 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/electrical/wire-length-calculator\">Wire Length Calculator<!-- --> →</a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 font-black text-slate-900 transition hover:border-emerald-300 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/electrical/dc-wire-size-calculator\">DC Wire Size Calculator<!-- --> →</a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 font-black text-slate-900 transition hover:border-emerald-300 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/electrical/3-phase-voltage-drop-calculator\">3-Phase Voltage Drop<!-- --> →</a><a class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 font-black text-slate-900 transition hover:border-emerald-300 hover:bg-emerald-50\" href=\"/electrical/cable-power-loss-calculator\">Cable Power Loss<!-- --> →</a></div><div class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-sky-200 bg-sky-50 p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black text-sky-950\">Designing a solar system too?</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-sky-900\">Use the dedicated solar load, panel, inverter and battery sizing workflow on our solar calculator subdomain, then return here for cable voltage-drop planning.</p><a href=\"https://solarcalculator.greenengineeringtools.com\" class=\"mt-4 inline-flex rounded-xl bg-sky-700 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-black text-white hover:bg-sky-600\">Open Solar Calculator ↗</a></div><div class=\"mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-amber-950\"><strong>Responsible-use notice:</strong> These results are for engineering planning and education. They do not replace a licensed electrical professional, manufacturer instructions, local electrical codes, the authority having jurisdiction, protection studies, fault-current analysis, or site-specific installation design.</div></div></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-auto w-full border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-slate-400\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 text-center sm:grid-cols-2 sm:text-left lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:justify-start\" href=\"/\">GreenEngineering Tools</a><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400 sm:mx-0\">Free browser-based engineering tools for carbon, CBAM, electrical systems and sustainable design.</p><a class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300\" href=\"/electrical\">Explore electrical tools →</a></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Core tools</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer core tools navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">LCA Engine</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Estimator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical\">Electrical Tools</a><a href=\"https://solarcalculator.greenengineeringtools.com\" class=\"block hover:text-white\">Solar Calculator ↗</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase